{"id":"aca5dea67980dea1","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-pure-decision.md","title":"Pure Decision","display":"df-pure-decision — Pure Decision","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pure-decision","aliases":["58-df-pure-decision"],"display":"df-pure-decision — Pure Decision","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pure-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pure-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pure-decision — Pure Decision"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash\\in V\">\\(P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}decision}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S(P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land R^*\\subseteq R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Neg},\\mathcal S,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\Vdash\\subseteq P\\times\\mathcal S\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land(\\langle q,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash\n\\lor\\langle q,\\mathrm{Neg}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in\\Vdash)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}decision}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S(P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land R^*\\subseteq R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Neg},\\mathcal S,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\Vdash\\subseteq P\\times\\mathcal S\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land(\\langle q,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash\n\\lor\\langle q,\\mathrm{Neg}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in\\Vdash)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^*\">\\(R^*\\)</span> is the pure-extension relation, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}\\)</span> is syntactic negation, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash\">\\(\\Vdash\\)</span> is the forcing relation restricted to conditions and sentences.</li>\n<li>Pure decision means deciding formulas by pure extensions.</li>\n<li>Fusion-style forcings often use pure decision.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}decision}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PureDecision}_S(P,R,R^*,\\mathcal S,\\mathrm{Neg},\\Vdash)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\n\\land R^*\\subseteq R\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{Neg},\\mathcal S,\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\Vdash\\subseteq P\\times\\mathcal S\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall p\\in P\\;\n\\exists q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land(\\langle q,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\Vdash\n\\lor\\langle q,\\mathrm{Neg}(\\varphi)\\rangle\\in\\Vdash)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash","display":false}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1016","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-pure-decision.md|58-df-pure-decision]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751"]}